/Title (Conclusion In this lab, we implemented and compared various sorting and searching algorithms using  AI assistance. Quick Sort and Merge Sort were tested on large datasets and their  performance differences were analyzed. Bubble Sort helped in understanding basic  comparison-based sorting and its time complexity . Hash Maps demonstrated efficient O\(1\)  searching in real-time applications like inventory and stock systems.)
